      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "priority_queue<int,vector<int>,greater<int>>pq; minHeap\n\nfor(int i = 0 ; i < n ; i++) {\n    pq.push(nums[i])\n    if(pq.size()>k){\n        pq.pop();\n    }\n}\n\n// remaining are greatest k elements\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "priority_queue<int,vector<int>,greater<int>>pq; minHeap\n\nfor(int i = 0 ; i < n ; i++) {\n    pq.push(nums[i])\n    if(pq.size()>k){\n        pq.pop();\n    }\n}\n\n// remaining are greatest k elements\n\n",
